Name: google-cloud-go
Short Name: google-cloud-go
URL: https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-go
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: HEAD
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/google-cloud-go
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/google-cloud-go

Description:
Google Cloud client libraries for Go. Provides typed clients for Cloud Storage, Cloud Spanner,
BigQuery, Secret Manager, Cloud Run, Pub/Sub, Vertex AI, and Cloud DNS.

Local Modifications:
- Forked to aphrody-labs/google-cloud-go and yolo-rs/google-cloud-go.
- Native gRPC / Protobuf transport with Application Default Credentials (ADC) and automatic keyless service account rotation.
- Consumed by packages/gcp-client in Google Bun.
